  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Anar Mammadov is an Azerbaijani businessman and former chairman of ZQAN, later renamed Garant Holding, whose interests spanned construction, transport, finance and hotels. The son of former transport minister Ziya Mammadov, he studied business administration in London. His British investments have included property and controlling stakes in KFC restaurant operators.",
